config OPPO_FINGERPRINT
	bool "OPPO fingerprint driver"
	depends on GPIOLIB && INPUT
	help
	  Say Y here to enable OPPO fingerprint support for SDM660 devices.

	  This builds the common fingerprint ID detection (oppo,fp_common),
	  the FPC1020 TEE platform driver, and on R11s devices the Goodix
	  fingerprint platform driver.
